<!-- Made Running sitemap. Hand-maintained: the public surface is six URLs
     and changes only when a route is added, so a build-time generator would
     be more machinery than content. Class pages (/c/:slug) join the list
     when the class database goes live and the slugs become stable.

     /join is deliberately ABSENT (Oct 2026). The club asked for every "Join
     the Community" button removed — see src/lib/joinPublic.js — and a
     sitemap is a request to a crawler to index and rank a page, not a note
     to ourselves. Listing a form no button offers would have left it as the
     top result for "join made running": a LOUDER door than the one we just
     took down, not a quieter one. The route still works for anyone the club
     sends the URL to; it is simply no longer advertised.

     If JOIN_PUBLIC goes back to true, add the entry back here too — the
     buttons and this file have to agree about what the site offers. -->
